{%- if kind == 'binary' %} the archive, `SHA256SUMS` and `attestation.json` file names.
{%- else %} the image `ghcr.io/{{ github_owner | lower }}/{{ project_name }}`.
{%- endif %} Changing
one breaks the commands users have copied.
